{"id":"3850151d9f29cbf4","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-characteristic-indices.md","title":"Σ₁、特征函数与双枚举索引","display":"df-characteristic-indices — Σ₁、特征函数与双枚举索引","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-characteristic-indices","aliases":["20-df-characteristic-indices"],"display":"df-characteristic-indices — Σ₁、特征函数与双枚举索引","chapter":"2","section":"2.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 2.3.1","source_printed_pages":[33],"source_pdf_pages":[69],"depends_on":["[[20-df-numbering]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-characteristic-indices"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-characteristic-indices</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-characteristic-indices — Σ₁、特征函数与双枚举索引"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 2.3.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>33</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>69</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,i,j\\in\\omega\">\\(e,i,j\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dc642dd12c05d028\" href=\"?note=dc642dd12c05d028\" title=\"20-df-numbering\">20-df-numbering</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}indices}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\operatorname{CEInd}(e,A)\\Longleftrightarrow W_e=A,\\\\ \\operatorname{CharInd}(i,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi_i=\\chi_A,\\\\ \\operatorname{DualInd}(\\langle e,j\\rangle,A)\\Longleftrightarrow W_e=A\\land W_j=\\omega\\setminus A.\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}indices}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\\operatorname{CEInd}(e,A)\\Longleftrightarrow W_e=A,\\\\ \\operatorname{CharInd}(i,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\varphi_i=\\chi_A,\\\\ \\operatorname{DualInd}(\\langle e,j\\rangle,A)\\Longleftrightarrow W_e=A\\land W_j=\\omega\\setminus A.\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>CharInd 中的相等包括在全部输入上停止、输出 0 或 1。DualInd 的两枚举必须恰为互补集合。索引是有限数据，而完成后的集合性质不能自动从单个 CEInd 读出。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 2.3.1；印刷页 33；PDF 第 69 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-characteristic]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"dc642dd12c05d028","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-characteristic","status":"resolved","id":"de14d8d6c42250de","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-numbering]]；see [[20-df-characteristic]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"targ